### GPU Worker - All Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### GPU Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/gpu-stats

### Worker ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/worker-id

### Capabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/capabilities

### Single Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is artificial intelligence?",
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "top_k": 3
}

### Query with different top_k
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Explain neural networks",
  "user_id": "user-456",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Cache Test - Same Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is artificial intelligence?",
  "top_k": 3
}

### Batch Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/query/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queries": [
    {"query": "What is deep learning?", "top_k": 3},
    {"query": "What is a neural network?", "top_k": 3},
    {"query": "Explain machine learning", "top_k": 3}
  ]
}